      "description": "",
      "bio": "Aura is an initiative by Ann an experienced Ayurvedic practitioner hailing from the Kerala ‘the cradle of Ayurveda Ann completed her Bachelors in Ayuvedic Medicine and Surgery (6 years course) from prestigious Govt Ayurveda College, Kannur Kerala, India. She was fortunate enough to be taught by renowned doctors in India. This gave her an opportunity to work close with the public system and became familiar with many complex and chronic cases. She is registered under the Travancore-Cochin Council of Indian System of Medicine. She has been practising Ayurveda since 2008 and special interest in musculoskeletal disorders, digestive disorders, skin diseases, respiratory diseases, urinary diseases, gynaecology and pregnancy care. She has participated and presented research papers in many workshops and seminars. She has been practising Ayurveda in Perth since 2015. Come and experience the holistic healing and legacy of Ayurveda, at Aura.",
